     On 64-bit architectures that provide 32-bit binary compatibility, the
     mappings in _/_e_t_c_/_l_i_b_m_a_p_._c_o_n_f apply only to 64-bit binaries.  Mappings for
     32-bit binaries must be placed in _/_e_t_c_/_l_i_b_m_a_p_3_2_._c_o_n_f.

